This directory adapts material from the Apache-2.0 licensed
code-modernization plugin at:

https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official

Source path: `plugins/code-modernization`.

The material has been modified for a repository-local Java 8 to modern-Java
modernization method kit: upstream commands became skills, specialist agents
became role briefs, and two orchestration workflows became deterministic
Python scripts. Product branding and installation mechanics were removed.

Date of this modification: 2026-09-08.

The upstream `LICENSE` has no copyright-holder line; its appendix is the
unfilled Apache boilerplate. This NOTICE therefore records the source and
adaptation explicitly. The complete Apache-2.0 text is in
`.agents/LICENSE-APACHE-2.0`.
